    <string name="settings_map_filters_keeps_unknown">该系统没有说明情况的站点仍留在地图上：谁都读不到的数量，不等于数量为零。</string>

    <!-- The bikes a network reports outside its stations (SPEC §4.1, §7.1,
         §7.6), and everything said about them. Off by default: the setting is
         opt-in twice over, for the markers it draws — whether one may take
         such a bike where it stands is the network's rule, and the feed does
         not carry it — and for the feed it reads, twenty times the weight of
         the station feed.

         The sentence under the switch is the whole of what the row says about
         a network: one that publishes no such feed shows nothing at all, and
         the map says that by drawing nothing. -->
    <string name="settings_street_bikes">显示站点外的自行车</string>
    <string name="settings_street_bikes_description">能否就地借用，取决于该系统的规定。</string>

    <!-- Shown once, the first time the switch above is turned on, and readable
         again from the sheet of any such bike. It informs and does not
         confirm: the switch is already on when it opens, and one button closes
         it. Three short paragraphs, kept short because a modal window is no
         place for dense text (SPEC §7.9) — what they are, what the application
         cannot vouch for, and where a journey from one ends. -->
    <string name="street_bike_intro_title">站点外的自行车</string>
    <string name="street_bike_intro_body">该系统报告这些自行车不在它的站点上。有的是用户随手停在那里的，有的在运营方的车库里等待。\n\nRoue Libre 无法判断您是否可以就地取用：这由该系统的规定决定，有的系统还会对停在站点外归还的车收取罚金。\n\n从一辆车出发的路线，终点始终是一个站点。</string>
    <string name="street_bike_intro_dismiss">知道了</string>

    <!-- The sheet a bike outside stations opens (SPEC §7.2.1), in the station
         sheet's shape and with less to say: a bike is one bike, and nothing is
         counted on it. The row below reopens the explanation above, so its
         words are readable again without switching the setting off and on. -->
    <string name="street_bike_intro_reopen">这些车是什么</string>
    <string name="street_bike_title">站点外的自行车</string>
    <string name="street_bike_kind_mechanical">普通自行车</string>
    <string name="street_bike_kind_electric">电动助力自行车</string>
    <string name="street_bike_kind_cargo">载货自行车</string>
